As you can see, `"` breaks the generated code because `FunctionTemplate.tt` encodes description using `@"...."` and didn't process the `"` in the comment description.


The quickest fix is to encode `"` in description by doubling it (`""`). This is how `"` is encoded as well in [verbatim string](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/tokens/verbatim).

