When you pass `admin` in group chat's constructor, it will use the `admin` to create an `RolePlayOrchestrator` and set it as groupchat's orchestrator. Check the code [here](https://github.com/microsoft/autogen/blob/3b45aa42c61c71fa149085aca2e2ba0e666b1d54/dotnet/src/AutoGen.Core/GroupChat/GroupChat.cs#L42) for more information.

