```
var groupChat = new GroupChat([admin, intentAgent, vitalsAgent, medicationsAgent], new MyOrchestrator());
```

to 
```
var groupChat = new GroupChat([intentAgent, vitalsAgent, medicationsAgent], new MyOrchestrator());
```

And you probably need to pass `RolePlayOrchestrator` to `MyOrchestrator` as well, which turns the code into:
```
var rolePlayOrchestrator = new RolePlayOrchestrator(admin);
